# identitynow_sim_integration

Manages a service integration module (SIM) integration. A SIM integration creates service desk tickets, e.g. ServiceNow service requests, for the provisioning requests of its sources and maps the ticket status back to the provisioning result.

The resource uses an experimental API; the provider sends the required `X-SailPoint-Experimental` header. Updates replace the whole integration (PUT) with the configured values.

